$ tabfmt -h
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
usage: tabfmt [flags] [FILE]
  -delim string
    	field delimiter: a single character, or "\t" for tab (default ",")
  -format string
    	output format: plain, markdown or box (default "plain")
  -max-width int
    	truncate cells longer than N characters (0 = no limit)
